window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>2 Volumes for a single credit!</b></p> <p>Reborn Noble 3—Rebirth of the Disgraced Noble Son</p> <p>Death was only the beginning. Given a second chance at life, Jäger Paldane must prevent the fall of his noble house and the empire itself. Armed with memories of a dark future and bound to an ancient goddess of war, he'll need every advantage to survive.</p> <p>Reborn into his younger self, Jäger Paldane has one chance to prevent the catastrophe that destroyed his family and brought the empire to its knees. But between noble politics, a widening conspiracy, and a growing corruption threatening to consume him from within, Jäger discovers that knowing the future doesn't make it any easier to change.</p> <p>Some fates demand more than just knowledge to overcome. They demand everything you are, and everything you might become.</p> <p>Reborn Noble 4—A Dark Fantasy LitRPG</p> <p>The walls between worlds grow thin as an ancient tower's power fades. Within the Imperial Academy, Jäger Paldane and his Dragon House allies face betrayal on all sides as House Sinvarian's demonic army emerges from hiding. A deadly poison targeting dragon blood forces Jäger to push his dark powers to their limit, but each time he uses the Blade of Shadows he risks losing himself entirely.</p> <p>The fate of his family and the empire itself hinges on reaching the Tower of Flastaff, assuming anything human remains of him by the time they reach it.</p>"; 
